
# type(scope): subject — imperative, at most ~72 characters, no full stop
#   types:  feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
#   scopes: api web core persona db ingest docs ci deps (or none)
#   breaking change: type(scope)!: subject, and a "BREAKING CHANGE: ..." line below
#
# Then a blank line, and WHY: what was wrong or missing, and why this is the fix.
# The diff already says what changed.
